<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-25T12:40:45.214Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:40:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to raid villages in northeast and eastern Nigeria, killing at least ten civilians and looting shops, while a separate attack on a village after Friday prayers left twenty dead and later rose to forty. Bandits attacked women harvesting groundnuts in Plateau, killing a woman and injuring two farmers. Community hunters in Katsina killed fourteen bandits and foiled a kidnap plot, and hunters in another area killed fourteen suspected bandits. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE42RENQLVk0SzNyNjZPTmdZelUyWVM4ZjdhaDhwZmZGQUJsbXR4R2hieTduR25WY0V3ZkJVMWF0SHZ3VXg2WHVkS3REcUNnbmdHajE3NG5RRzkzRkdUM3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNdmdYcU0xWU1mTVNWTmV4QUpUN3hMc2I2ZTN6dDdMckdfLTBiNWNzVHNfLWxjM0tJMWhob2xuYV9rVlhrcHFDVW83ZmFWenhCcXpaZVE5WlpoT0ptQTI1dzg5cEpaWWlfSE1oLWFudXRIM1FJTzVkTHhPVFIxc3c4UklyQ0NYZVU3NldnZW5LSnhRT2cwOS1ZY2ZnenNTdGYxblI0MWk1Ui1BLWtremQySQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arise News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNSVV4Q0l1bHgzckhoWUhBRE1pRnoxRURsZ3M5Rm1ITmFBcFVPejVWNlRuV2N3dWRVWjBkUHczbmppU2hfbEJxTThXRlNfRUtqbkZGc2tlVmRoOTFaQ1RWTmFSVnFBdTYtaVA0Szh4T3BwZmFERGdLcHFVNUFfb2tuSUJTV2hQcjQySU5aUVVSUDFUY2xKRjNkSUp0QU51alFycFFzZHRDMkEyWTFxbkotMWN0dXMyOGszNllQR3Zrb3NQOFpaNVpjYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQSXpNcU9lT195c0xxTXZXOVpVMlRsY1B4U3B2Q0dLazNSLUtkMWZ3el9hbmJsWnY2a3N6T20zZEFSZXI5ekZqTVMtckpNUkJCWXdSclNRc2tRZS1pS1NxT0JjbHB3a3YwWlB4NDVSWTZLYjJQaGhUNVh0ckNLc2hUb2JBVjBTdEUycDhfbzVYa1JxdndkY3lhbHNqcEo2M2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;